{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24640","headline":"以诗代书酬慕巢尚书见寄 · 白居易","name":"以诗代书酬慕巢尚书见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书意诗情不偶然，苦云梦想在林泉。\n愿爲愚谷烟霞侣，思结空门香火缘。\n每媿尚书情眷眷，自怜居士病绵绵。\n不知待得心期否，老挍於君六七年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}